  sequence:
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Mornin' Mr. Banker! I'd like to withdraw some of my gold, please!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Banker
    character: 10
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Banker
    content:
    - Oh, Cherry, Damson, thank goodness you're here!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Is something wrong?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Banker
    character: 10
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Banker
    content:
    - I... I don't know. Tell me, do you happen to have a green friend by the name
      of Fern?
    - I think I remember seeing you three returning from the dungeon.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - We sure do! What about him?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Banker
    character: 10
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Banker
    content:
    - Well, you see, just earlier today, I saw him walking to the dungeon.
    - But he wasn't alone. He was being accompanied by a bunch of scary-looking guys.
    - Fern seemed scared. I have a feeling your friend might be in trouble.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Fern's in trouble? We've got to help him!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Damson
    character: 1
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2733444605593320565, guid: dc0969557c4cf8f40bb757f8cb06197d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Damson
    content:
    - Do you happen to know where they were headed?
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Banker
    character: 10
    speakerSprite: {fileID: 792778199420499268, guid: b96f669342d0f4c4e9ef15c78ce4df9d, type: 3}
    speakerName: Banker
    content:
    - I heard they were on their way to Cobweb Cave.
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 0
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
  - name: Cherry
    character: 0
    speakerSprite: {fileID: -2069185945796123168, guid: 337ce6c3564cc8a4fb044661efac34b3, type: 3}
    speakerName: Cherry
    content:
    - Alright, thanks, Mr. Banker!
    waitTime: 0.05
    textSpeed: 0.05
    isRight: 0
    isSpriteShowing: 1
    canSkip: 1
    autoNext: 0
